gantt
  title Nooreign chronicle — 32 eras, 470 BCE to 2026 CE
  %% HOW TO READ THIS CHART
  %% Years in the seed data are SIGNED INTEGERS: -470 means 470 BCE, 0 is not a
  %% real year, and the BCE/CE divide sits at year 1. Mermaid gantt cannot plot a
  %% negative calendar year, so the axis below is a LINEAR COMPRESSION: the axis
  %% position is derived from the signed year, but the printed dates are synthetic.
  %% Read the BRACKETED YEAR RANGE on each bar, not the bar length. Bar length is
  %% scaled (3 chart-days per historical year) and floored at 40 chart-days so that
  %% single-year eras such as Asilomar 1986 are still visible.
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat %Y
  todayMarker off

